# Copy to deploy/.env (gitignored) and fill in. Never commit the real file.
# Nothing here is needed for the scanner itself today: Kalshi market data is public.

# Data's recorder / cross-venue collectors (later). Paid key shared with the owner's other apps.
# ODDS_API_KEY=

# Optional Caddy profile (public dashboard behind basic auth + HTTPS).
# DASHBOARD_DOMAIN=dash.example.com
# DASHBOARD_USER=owner
# DASHBOARD_PASSWORD_HASH=   # from: caddy hash-password; escape each $ as $$ in this file
